  "item_short_desc": "<p>Our 8 Inch Black Steel Toe Jungle Boots blends classic style with modern functionality, featuring a comfortable canvas and leather upper construction that keeps your feet dry in any climate. The tactical uniform boot comes equipped with dual vent holes designed for arid and humid weather conditions, great for military personnel, tactical professionals, and outdoor adventurers.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
